# Help
msgid "❓ <b>How to use this bot:</b>\n\n1. Get your Monobank token:\n   • Open Monobank app\n   • Go to Settings → API\n   • Create a token\n\n2. Add token in Settings\n\n3. Select accounts to track\n\n4. Set your preferred report time in Settings\n\nYou can also get report manually anytime!"
msgstr "❓ <b>How to use this bot:</b>\n\n1. Get your Monobank token:\n   • Open Monobank app\n   • Go to Settings → API\n   • Create a token\n\n2. Add token in Settings\n\n3. Select accounts to track\n\n4. Set your preferred report time in Settings\n\nYou can also get report manually anytime!"

