msgstr "🔑 <b>Enter Monobank Token</b>\n\nGet your token:\n1. Open Monobank app\n2. Go to Settings → API\n3. Create a token\n4. Send the token here\n\nToken format: uXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX"

